<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3 {
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .header-title {
    font-size: 24pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-bottom: 5px;
  }
  .header-subtitle {
    font-size: 14pt;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-size: 14pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .form-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    font-size: 11pt;
  }
  .form-group {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .form-group label {
    margin-right: 15px;
    font-weight: normal;
  }
  .input-field {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
    padding: 2px 0;
    flex-grow: 1;
    min-width: 100px;
  }
  .checkbox-group label {
    font-weight: normal;
    margin-right: 15px;
  }
  .table-container {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-top: 10px;
    font-size: 10pt;
  }
  .table-container th, .table-container td {
    border: 1px solid #000;
    padding: 5px;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .table-container th {
    background-color: #f0f0f0;
  }
  .signature-line {
    margin-top: 50px;
    text-align: center;
  }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-title">ILLINOIS TECH</div>
  <div class="header-subtitle">NROTC Preparatory Program<br>Scholarship Application</div>

  <div class="section-title">Application Checklist</div>
  <div class="checkbox-group">
    <div class="form-group">
      <input type="checkbox">
      <label>Illinois Tech NROTC Preparatory Scholarship Application</label>
    </div>
    <div class="form-group">
      <input type="checkbox">
      <label>Apply to Illinois Tech through the Common Application</label>
    </div>
    <div class="form-group">
      <input type="checkbox">
      <label>High School Transcript and SAT/ACT Official Report</label>
    </div>
    <div class="form-group">
      <input type="checkbox">
      <label>Apply for Free Application for Federal Student Aid (FAFSA) Illinois Tech ID: <span data-field="id_number">{{ id_number }}</span></label>
    </div>
    <div class="form-group">
      <input type="checkbox">
      <label>Letters of Recommendation (SNSI recommendation required if NROTC)</label>
    </div>
    <div class="form-group">
      <input type="checkbox">
      <label>Report of Medical History, signed by your physician (do not include social security number)</label>
    </div>
    <div class="form-group">
      <input type="checkbox">
      <label>Report of Medical Examination, signed by your physician (do not include social security number)</label>
    </div>
    <div class="form-group">
      <input type="checkbox">
      <label>Drug Statement</label>
    </div>
    <div class="form-group">
      <input type="checkbox">
      <label>Official Applicant Fitness Assessment (AFA) Score Sheet</label>
    </div>
    <div class="form-group">
      <input type="checkbox">
      <label>Completed Annual Certificate of Physical Condition</label>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="section-title">Instructions</div>
  <ol style="font-size: 11pt;">
    <li>Submit your application and supplemental materials to Illinois Tech through the Common App.</li>
    <li>Download the Presidential NROTC Preparatory Scholarship application form, the AFA scoring sheet, the Report of Medical History, Report of Medical, and the Drug Statement at <span data-field="url_1">{{ url_1 }}</span>.</li>
    <li>Fill out the NROTC application form by typing directly into the document. Once completed, print out the application and sign it using a pen.</li>
    <li>Upload the following signed and completed forms to <span data-field="url_2">{{ url_2 }}</span>:
      <ul>
        <li>Presidential NROTC Preparatory Scholarship Application form</li>
        <li>Drug Statement</li>
        <li>Report of Medical History</li>
        <li>Report of Medical Examination</li>
      </ul>
    </li>
    <li>Have a copy of all school, or your Senior Naval Science Instructor administer the AFA and email the signed copy of the AFA score sheet to <span data-field="email_1">{{ email_1 }}</span>. This should be sent in by the person who administered the test, not by the applicant.</li>
    <li>You must obtain a letter of recommendation from either your SNSI or a Math or English teacher. Additional letters of recommendation from other sources are encouraged but not required. All letters of recommendation must be emailed by the person writing the recommendation to <span data-field="email_2">{{ email_2 }}</span>.</li>
    <li>If you have any questions, please do not hesitate to contact:</li>
  </ol>

  <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between;">
      <div style="width: 40%;">
        <p><strong>LT Joshua Smith</strong></p>
        <p>10 W 35th Street</p>
        <p>Tower Building, 15th Floor</p>
        <p>Chicago, IL <span data-field="zip_code">{{ zip_code }}</span></p>
        <p>Phone: <span data-field="phone">{{ phone }}</span></p>
        <p>Email: <span data-field="email_contact">{{ email_contact }}</span></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-title">ILLINOIS TECH</div>
  <div class="header-subtitle">NROTC Preparatory Program<br>Scholarship Application</div>

  <div class="section-title">Personal Information</div>
  <p>Please enter your name as it appears on your passport or other official documents.</p>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div style="width: 30%;">
      <div class="form-group">
        <label>Name:</label>
        <span class="input-field" style="width: 60%;">{{ full_name }}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <label>Last (Family):</label>
        <span class="input-field" style="width: 20%;">{{ last_name }}</span>
        <label>First:</label>
        <span class="input-field" style="width: 20%;">{{ first_name }}</span>
        <label>Middle:</label>
        <span class="input-field" style="width: 20%;">{{ middle_name }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 30%;">
      <div class="form-group">
        <label>Date of Birth:</label>
        <span class="input-field" style="width: 40%;">{{ date_of_birth }}</span>
        <label>Suffix (Jr., Sr., etc.):</label>
        <span class="input-field" style="width: 20%;">{{ suffix }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div style="width: 30%;">
      <div class="form-group">
        <label>Legal Sex:</label>
        <div class="checkbox-group">
          <input type="radio" name="legal_sex" value="Male">
          <label>Male</label>
          <input type="radio" name="legal_sex" value="Female">
          <label>Female</label>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <label>Preferred Name:</label>
        <span class="input-field" style="width: 60%;">{{ preferred_name }}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <label>Email:</label>
        <span class="input-field" style="width: 60%;">{{ email_address }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 30%;">
      <div class="form-group">
        <label>Previous Last Name(s), if any:</label>
        <span class="input-field" style="width: 60%;">{{ previous_last_name }}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <label>Intended Major or Area of Study:</label>
        <span class="input-field" style="width: 60%;">{{ intended_major }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">Permanent Address</div>
  <div class="form-row">
    <div style="width: 30%;">
      <div class="form-group">
        <label>Street Address:</label>
        <span class="input-field" style="width: 90%;">{{ street_address }}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <label>Apt. #:</label>
        <span class="input-field" style="width: 10%;">{{ apartment_number }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 30%;">
      <div class="form-group">
        <label>City/Town:</label>
        <span class="input-field" style="width: 60%;">{{ city_town }}</span>
        <label>State/Province:</label>
        <span class="input-field" style="width: 25%;">{{ state_province }}</span>
        <label>Country:</label>
        <span class="input-field" style="width: 15%;">{{ country }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 30%;">
      <div class="form-group">
        <label>Zip/Postal Code:</label>
        <span class="input-field" style="width: 90%;">{{ zip_postal_code }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">Phone</div>
  <div class="form-row">
    <div style="width: 50%;">
      <div class="form-group">
        <label>Begin with Area or Country Code:</label>
        <span class="input-field" style="width: 30%;">{{ phone_area_code }}</span>
        <label>Alternate Phone:</label>
        <span class="input-field" style="width: 30%;">{{ alternate_phone }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">Citizenship</div>
  <div class="form-group">
    <label>Place of Birth:</label>
    <span class="input-field" style="width: 30%;">{{ birth_city }}</span>
    <span class="input-field" style="width: 20%;">{{ birth_state }}</span>
    <span class="input-field" style="width: 20%;">{{ birth_country }}</span>
  </div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <label>US Citizen:</label>
    <input type="radio" name="citizenship" value="US">
    <label>US Citizen</label>
    <label>Dual US citizen; please specify other country of citizenship</label>
    <span class="input-field" style="width: 30%;">{{ dual_citizenship_country }}</span>
  </div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <label>US permanent resident visa; citizen of:</label>
    <span class="input-field" style="width: 40%;">{{ permanent_resident_country }}</span>
    <label>Alien registration number:</label>
    <span class="input-field" style="width: 30%;">{{ alien_registration_number }}</span>
  </div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <label>Other Citizenship:</label>
    <input type="radio" name="citizenship" value="Other">
    <label>Other Citizenship</label>
    <span class="input-field" style="width: 60%;">{{ other_citizenship_details }}</span>
  </div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <label>If you live in the United States, but are not a U.S. citizen, how many years have you lived in the country?</label>
    <span class="input-field" style="width: 40%;">{{ years_in_us }}</span>
  </div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <label>If not English, language spoken in your home:</label>
    <span class="input-field" style="width: 40%;">{{ home_language }}</span>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">Ethnicity</div>
  <p>Race/Ethnicity information is optional. Information you provide will not be used in a discriminatory manner and will not be used as a factor for selection or disqualification.</p>
  <p>Are you Hispanic or Latino?</p>
  <div class="checkbox-group">
    <input type="radio" name="hispanic_latino" value="Yes">
    <label>Yes</label>
    <input type="radio" name="hispanic_latino" value="No">
    <label>No</label>
    <span class="input-field" style="width: 30%;">{{ origin_details }}</span>
  </div>

  <p>How would you describe your racial background? (select one or more of the following categories:)</p>
  <div class="checkbox-group">
    <input type="checkbox" name="race" value="Asian">
    <label>Asian (country of family's origin)</label>
    <input type="checkbox" name="race" value="Black">
    <label>Black or African American</label>
    <input type="checkbox" name="race" value="American">
    <label>American Indian or Alaska Native (enrolled)</label>
    <input type="checkbox" name="race" value="Tribal">
    <label>Tribal affiliation</label>
  </div>
  <div class="checkbox-group" style="margin-top: 10px;">
    <input type="checkbox" name="race" value="NativeHawaiian">
    <label>Native Hawaiian or Other Pacific Islander</label>
    <input type="checkbox" name="race" value="White">
    <label>White</label>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-title">ILLINOIS TECH</div>
  <div class="header-subtitle">NROTC Preparatory Program<br>Scholarship Application</div>

  <div class="section-title">Academic Information</div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div style="width: 20%;">
      <div class="form-group">
        <label>School:</label>
        <span class="input-field" style="width: 80%;">{{ school_name }}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <label>Type of school:</label>
        <div class="checkbox-group">
          <input type="checkbox" name="school_type" value="Public">
          <label>Public</label>
          <input type="checkbox" name="school_type" value="Private">
          <label>Private</label>
          <input type="checkbox" name="school_type" value="Correspondence">
          <label>Correspondence</label>
          <input type="checkbox" name="school_type" value="Charter">
          <label>Charter</label>
          <input type="checkbox" name="school_type" value="Parochial">
          <label>Parochial</label>
          <input type="checkbox" name="school_type" value="Home-School">
          <label>Home-School</label>
          <input type="checkbox" name="school_type" value="Other">
          <label>Other/Education Provider</label>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 40%;">
      <div class="form-group">
        <label>School Address:</label>
        <span class="input-field" style="width: 90%;">{{ school_address }}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <label>City/Town:</label>
        <span class="input-field" style="width: 60%;">{{ school_city }}</span>
        <label>State/Province:</label>
        <span class="input-field" style="width: 20%;">{{ school_state }}</span>
        <label>Country:</label>
        <span class="input-field" style="width: 10%;">{{ school_country }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 40%;">
      <div class="form-group">
        <label>Zip/Postal Code:</label>
        <span class="input-field" style="width: 90%;">{{ school_zip_code }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div style="width: 30%;">
      <div class="form-group">
        <label>Start Date:</label>
        <span class="input-field" style="width: 40%;">{{ start_date }}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <label>Counselor's Name:</label>
        <span class="input-field" style="width: 60%;">{{ counselor_name }}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <label>Counselor's Email:</label>
        <span class="input-field" style="width: 60%;">{{ counselor_email }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 30%;">
      <div class="form-group">
        <label>Date of Graduation:</label>
        <span class="input-field" style="width: 40%;">{{ graduation_date }}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <label>Phone:</label>
        <span class="input-field" style="width: 60%;">{{ counselor_phone }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div style="width: 100%;">
      <div class="form-group">
        <label>Are you currently enrolled in school?</label>
        <div class="checkbox-group">
          <input type="checkbox" name="enrolled" value="Yes">
          <label>Yes</label>
          <input type="checkbox" name="enrolled" value="No">
          <label>No</label>
          <input type="checkbox" name="graduating" value="Will graduate from High School early">
          <label>Will graduate from High School early</label>
          <input type="checkbox" name="graduating" value="Yes">
          <label>Yes</label>
          <input type="checkbox" name="graduating" value="No">
          <label>No</label>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">Current Year's Courses</div>
  <p>Please list name, level (Honors, AP, IB, etc.) and credit value of your current year's courses.</p>
  <table class="table-container">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Semester #1/Trimester #1</th>
        <th>Semester #2/Trimester #2</th>
        <th>Trimester #3</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td><span class="input-field" style="width: 95%;">{{ course_1_1 }}</span></td>
        <td><span class="input-field" style="width: 95%;">{{ course_1_2 }}</span></td>
        <td><span class="input-field" style="width: 95%;">{{ course_1_3 }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <!-- More rows would be added dynamically if needed, but based on layout, we keep it simple -->
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div class="section-title">Other High Schools</div>
  <p>List all other high schools, colleges/universities (including summers), and academic programs you attended, beginning with ninth grade. You must submit transcripts from each school.</p>
  <table class="table-container">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>School Name</th>
        <th>CEEB Code</th>
        <th>Dates Attended</th>
        <th>Location</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for item in other_high_schools %}
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="other_high_schools[{{ loop.index0 }}].school_name">{{ item.school_name }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="other_high_schools[{{ loop.index0 }}].ceeb_code">{{ item.ceeb_code }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="other_high_schools[{{ loop.index0 }}].dates_attended">{{ item.dates_attended }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="other_high_schools[{{ loop.index0 }}].location">{{ item.location }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div class="section-title">Colleges/Universities</div>
  <table class="table-container">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>School Name</th>
        <th>CEEB Code</th>
        <th>Dates Attended</th>
        <th>Location</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for item in colleges_universities %}
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="colleges_universities[{{ loop.index0 }}].school_name">{{ item.school_name }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="colleges_universities[{{ loop.index0 }}].ceeb_code">{{ item.ceeb_code }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="colleges_universities[{{ loop.index0 }}].dates_attended">{{ item.dates_attended }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="colleges_universities[{{ loop.index0 }}].location">{{ item.location }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-title">ILLINOIS TECH</div>
  <div class="header-subtitle">NROTC Preparatory Program<br>Scholarship Application</div>

  <div class="section-title">Advanced Placement or International Baccalaureate Exams</div>
  <p>Please list any Advanced Placement or International Baccalaureate exams taken along with the test date and score.</p>

  <div class="section-title">SAT Subject</div>
  <table class="table-container">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Test Date</th>
        <th>Subject</th>
        <th>Score</th>
        <th>Test Date</th>
        <th>Subject</th>
        <th>Score</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td><span class="input-field" style="width: 20%;">{{ sat_subject_date_1 }}</span></td>
        <td><span class="input-field" style="width: 20%;">{{ sat_subject_subject_1 }}</span></td>
        <td><span class="input-field" style="width: 20%;">{{ sat_subject_score_1 }}</span></td>
        <td><span class="input-field" style="width: 20%;">{{ sat_subject_date_2 }}</span></td>
        <td><span class="input-field" style="width: 20%;">{{ sat_subject_subject_2 }}</span></td>
        <td><span class="input-field" style="width: 20%;">{{ sat_subject_score_2 }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div class="section-title">SAT Reasoning</div>
  <table class="table-container">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Test Date</th>
        <th>Subject</th>
        <th>Score</th>
        <th>Test Date</th>
        <th>Subject</th>
        <th>Score</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td><span class="input-field" style="width: 20%;">{{ sat_reasoning_date_1 }}</span></td>
        <td><span class="input-field" style="width: 20%;">{{ sat_reasoning_subject_1 }}</span></td>
        <td><span class="input-field" style="width: 20%;">{{ sat_reasoning_score_1 }}</span></td>
        <td><span class="input-field" style="width: 20%;">{{ sat_reasoning_date_2 }}</span></td>
        <td><span class="input-field" style="width: 20%;">{{ sat_reasoning_subject_2 }}</span></td>
        <td><span class="input-field" style="width: 20%;">{{ sat_reasoning_score_2 }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div class="section-title">SAT Subject</div>
  <table class="table-container">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Test Date</th>
        <th>Subject</th>
        <th>Score</th>
        <th>Test Date</th>
        <th>Subject</th>
        <th>Score</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td><span class="input-field" style="width: 20%;">{{ sat_subject_date_3 }}</span></td>
        <td><span class="input-field" style="width: 20%;">{{ sat_subject_subject_3 }}</span></td>
        <td><span class="input-field" style="width: 20%;">{{ sat_subject_score_3 }}</span></td>
        <td><span class="input-field" style="width: 20%;">{{ sat_subject_date_4 }}</span></td>
        <td><span class="input-field" style="width: 20%;">{{ sat_subject_subject_4 }}</span></td>
        <td><span class="input-field" style="width: 20%;">{{ sat_subject_score_4 }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div class="section-title">ACT</div>
  <table class="table-container">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Test Date</th>
        <th>English</th>
        <th>Math</th>
        <th>Reading</th>
        <th>Science</th>
        <th>Composite</th>
        <th>Optional Essay</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td><span class="input-field" style="width: 15%;">{{ act_date_1 }}</span></td>
        <td><span class="input-field" style="width: 15%;">{{ act_english_1 }}</span></td>
        <td><span class="input-field" style="width: 15%;">{{ act_math_1 }}</span></td>
        <td><span class="input-field" style="width: 15%;">{{ act_reading_1 }}</span></td>
        <td><span class="input-field" style="width: 15%;">{{ act_science_1 }}</span></td>
        <td><span class="input-field" style="width: 15%;">{{ act_composite_1 }}</span></td>
        <td><span class="input-field" style="width: 15%;">{{ act_essay_1 }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div class="section-title">ASVAB</div>
  <div class="form-row">
    <div style="width: 30%;">
      <div class="form-group">
        <label>Test Date:</label>
        <span class="input-field" style="width: 60%;">{{ asvab_date }}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <label>AFQT Score:</label>
